{"id":2623,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为全力备战学校运动会，切实提升参赛运动员竞技水平，充分展现我院学子锐意进取、奋勇拼搏的良好精神风貌，近期，经济与管理学院有序组织全体参赛运动员开展常态化赛前集训，全体健儿凝心聚力、刻苦训练，以扎实备赛状态全力冲刺赛事征程。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PUmUYPnN-DM7LbU44LPozWRMmfkUm68fnlU8L8V2n7V7UmC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ybn1hVMkyDUNWRLR7aUzT2nz-ZnN7sM7-sUzLYU4CPMlrFU47bnmvaMRnFo77sMSb/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmLbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23239&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F9FE46BBC010A9FE28FA74B7A32C615E/C19F7044/8A75\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PUmUYPnN-DM7LbU44LPozWRMmfkUm68fnlU8L8V2n7V7UmC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ybn1hVMkyDUNWRLR7aUzT2nz-ZnN7sM7-sUzLYU4CPMlrFU47bnmvaMRnFo77sMSb/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmLbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23239&e=.jpeg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Pnm-YaMRM7UNCbM4ln2LNrfM8nRUNC88ol7DLR9YnNUZLmG0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaLSysL1y4oR-snlLbMzfVoRG8MlQRUzLZn7rkoRNZU4fFM8QkMR-ZnmrFUNUiLYb/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmLbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23239&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/901723827EC950E8045FCA38DEB898C0/7FB428F5/BD53\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Pnm-YaMRM7UNCbM4ln2LNrfM8nRUNC88ol7DLR9YnNUZLmG0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaLSysL1y4oR-snlLbMzfVoRG8MlQRUzLZn7rkoRNZU4fFM8QkMR-ZnmrFUNUiLYb/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmLbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23239&e=.jpeg\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>黄昏的运动场上，处处可见我院健儿刻苦训练的身影。短跑运动员反复冲刺，不断提升速度与爆发力。长跑选手坚持耐力训练，在一次次坚持中突破自我。田赛项目队员专注打磨助跑、起跳、投掷等技术动作。接力队伍一遍遍练习交接棒，默契配合、凝聚合力。铅球、手榴弹项目队员，提高全身协调度，规范投掷动作。训练全程，参训学生不畏训练辛劳、互帮互助携手共进，带队教练员全程现场跟训指导，细致纠正动作短板、科学优化训练方式，训练场整体呈现出团结奋进、实干争先的良好训练氛围。</p><p></p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PUzvYbLznVU4UDL44LZoRrkoR9bUzU88L8MVnmlaL4T2U4v0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hkoSyboSysMlUan7LboRNaMRC8n7rko7-ZozGaMlVRLNVFLmGPMRUDL4TFM87Pn1b/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmLbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23239&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2B99975D0DC9890464DEB8B89005AC2A/20144639/7A1F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PUzvYbLznVU4UDL44LZoRrkoR9bUzU88L8MVnmlaL4T2U4v0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hkoSyboSysMlUan7LboRNaMRC8n7rko7-ZozGaMlVRLNVFLmGPMRUDL4TFM87Pn1b/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmLbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23239&e=.jpeg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PL8UYYnm-DnRvaU4NWknNrRnmnkM468fMzCYMRnRnlQVLNU0gihFp2hmCIa0okyYUSyan1hfMz9in7U4LmM2M4lPU4C8U8-PMm-4M77YU8rFUmGbM8-iozMFMNUbn1b/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmLbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23239&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/82A0FA585DD323F751C64CB16234A2CE/B097B593/6D9F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PL8UYYnm-DnRvaU4NWknNrRnmnkM468fMzCYMRnRnlQVLNU0gihFp2hmCIa0okyYUSyan1hfMz9in7U4LmM2M4lPU4C8U8-PMm-4M77YU8rFUmGbM8-iozMFMNUbn1b/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmLbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23239&e=.jpeg\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>一张张训练照片，定格了运动员们全力以赴的动人瞬间：奔跑时坚定的眼神、冲刺时紧绷的姿态、休息时彼此加油的笑容，无不展现出经管学子敢闯敢拼、永不言弃的青春风采。本次赛前常态化集训，不仅有效提升了全体参赛运动员专项竞技能力与赛场适应能力，更在训练实践中锤炼学子坚韧意志品质，进一步凝聚向心力与学院集体荣誉感。</p><p></p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PMRGYaLm9DU4U8M4m6RnRCZMR-DMNl84MRGanzC4MRr2ozL0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hRLSyaM1ysnN7bnzn2L4UPUln7UlQVUlWRM7-PMNlDU4fFMz9aLzNDnRWFoz6foSb/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmLbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23239&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6C1067FA9E4F341ADDAFEABC4B16E6C0/580196D2/97A9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" or